      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The occurrence of Henoch-Schönlein purpura in a man and his two daughters on widely separated occasions is reported. No common drug, infective agent or allergen could be identified as responsible and it is therefore considered possible that a familial basis may be the explanation."},
